"""Build a static figure companion using the same SVGs as the interactive explorer."""
from pathlib import Path
import html
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
figures=[
 ('architecture','System architecture','Existing foundations, proposed extensions and budget-blocked later stages are distinguished. The new head, retrieval and decoder must join a single qualified native owner; the diagram is a design, not a trained capability.','Flow Matching; Continuous GFlowNets; plan §§2–5.'),
 ('forest','Complete forest and solver time','Two fixed trees retain14 states,12 edges and eight complete paths. Two roots are clamped;12 free states follow a known analytic interpolation. Solver time is not reasoning depth. No learned sampler or biological coordinates are depicted.','Exact local fixture; plan §§2–4.'),
 ('reward','A reward-proportional finite distribution','Four mathematical fixture objects have q₀=(0.4,0.3,0.2,0.1) and E=(0.2,0.8,1.4,2.1). The bars normalize q₀ exp(−E), not empirical model frequencies. A maximum-score selector is a different object.','Continuous GFlowNets; explicit finite reference calculation.'),
 ('topology','Directed analogy and metric persistence','The supplied two-cell identifies paths ab and cd. It cannot be inferred from equal endpoints or a common barcode. The independent unit-square Rips example has one positive H₁ interval[1,√2). This finite illustration is not a biological homotopy reconstruction.','Grandis,printed pp.2–3 and §§1.4,2.1,3.2; Topological Autoencoders.'),
 ('decode','Final typed token refinement','The nearest unrestricted codebook vector can be invalid for the role. Grammar-aware refinement acts only on allowed candidates, but a token label never grants experimental provenance. Decoding changes probability masses through its many-to-one regions.','Plan §6; current native token/payload contracts; Jev typed-interface inspiration only.'),
 ('fewstep','Flow maps and discretization error','The exact scalar ODE x′=x has solution exp(s). The plotted Euler error is computed, not a learned benchmark. The exact one-step map is an analytic oracle. Neural1–4-step quality, diversity and end-to-end latency remain unmeasured.','MeanFlow; Decoupled MeanFlow; Align Your Flow; plan §7.'),
 ('quality','Contextual quality and adapter selection','GraphCG direction effects must be evaluated under matched contexts. Unknown evidence is not a negative label. BF16DoRA and QDoRA are qualification candidates; QLoRA is the comparison reference. The small matrix parameter counts are not the model count.','DoRA; QLoRA; PEFT0.21.0; ProteinBench and refolding limitations; plan §8.'),
 ('campaign','The unchanged training boundary','The current cap is24 native μP proxy runs plus two target runs. No verified actual outcome is shown. Additional distillation, preference adaptation or a trained baseline comparison cannot launch without a revised explicit run allocation.','Current campaign26 directive and 11November2026 local evidence snapshot.')]
style='''@page{size:letter landscape;margin:0.42in}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:#193747;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}.page{break-after:page;page-break-after:always}.page:last-child{break-after:auto;page-break-after:auto}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #c5d0d2;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:9px;font-size:12px}header strong{font-size:16px}.marker{color:#a15b15;font-size:11px}.figure{width:100%;height:480px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.figure svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:480px}.caption{font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px;border-top:1px solid #d5dfe0;padding-top:9px}.caption p{margin:0 0 6px}.source{font-size:10px;color:#526672}.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;color:#526672;padding-top:8px}.note{color:#80521e}'''
parts=[]
for i,(name,title,caption,source)in enumerate(figures,1):
 svg=(R/f'paper/figures/flow-forest-{name}.svg').read_text()
 parts.append(f'<section class="page"><header><strong>Mora-3 · Flow-forest methods</strong><span>FRF-00 / 11 November2026 / Figure{i:02d}</span></header><div class="marker">PROPOSED METHODS · EXACT MATHEMATICAL ILLUSTRATIONS · NOT TRAINED RESULTS</div><div class="figure">{svg}</div><div class="caption"><p><strong>Figure{i}. {html.escape(title)}.</strong> {html.escape(caption)}</p><p class="source">Sources: {html.escape(source)}</p></div><div class="foot"><span>Interactive companion: docs/project/flow-forest.html</span><span class="note">Mathematical figures; no trained biological-validity claim.</span></div></section>')
